// Maude - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# Maude is a rewriting-based language. A string is a term, and
# there is no print in the core language -- the greeting is the
# result the module returns.
process HelloWorld
begin
  "Hello World!"
end process
